function employeeForm(x){openDrawer('编辑员工',`<form><label>姓名<input name="name" required maxlength="128" value="${esc(x.name)}"></label>${checks(x)}<label>员工分组<select name="group_id">${groupOptions('employee',x.group_id)}</select></label><div class="callout">调组保留已有 Profile 历史和记忆，不自动提升文件访问权限。</div>${formEnd()}</form>`,'员工权限');bindForm(v=>management('employees/'+encodeURIComponent(x.id),'PUT',v));}
async function renderGroups(){const p=profile();const groups=p.groups.filter(x=>x.kind===selectedGroupKind);$('#main').innerHTML=`<section class="page">${heading('分组与模板','员工组与群组分别选用模板和目标节点。每个员工、每个群派生独立 Profile。','<button id="new-template">新建模板</button><button id="new-group" class="primary">新建分组</button>')}<div class="toolbar"><div class="filter-tabs"><button data-group-kind="employee" class="${selectedGroupKind==='employee'?'active':''}">员工分组</button><button data-group-kind="group" class="${selectedGroupKind==='group'?'active':''}">群聊分组</button></div></div><div class="surface"><div class="surface-title"><h2>${selectedGroupKind==='employee'?'员工分组':'群聊分组'}<span class="count">${groups.length}</span></h2></div>${groups.length?`<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>分组名称</th><th>配置模板</th><th>目标节点</th><th>成员数量</th><th class="action-col">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${groups.map(x=>`<tr><td><span class="person-name">${esc(x.name)}</span></td><td>${esc(itemName(p.templates,x.template_id))}<div class="row-note">版本 v${p.templates.find(t=>t.id===x.template_id)?.version||'—'}</div></td><td>${esc(itemName(p.nodes,x.node_id))}</td><td>${(x.kind==='employee'?p.employees:p.rooms).filter(m=>m.group_id===x.id).length}</td><td class="action-col"><button class="text-button" data-edit-group="${esc(x.id)}">编辑</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:empty('尚无此类分组','先创建适用模板和登记节点，再建立分组。','layers')}</div><div class="surface section-gap"><div class="surface-title"><h2>配置模板<span class="count">${p.templates.length}</span></h2><span class="help-text">受管字段：SOUL、display.language</span></div>${p.templates.length?`<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>模板</th><th>适用对象</th><th>当前版本</th><th>派生档案</th><th>同步情况</th><th class="action-col">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${p.templates.map(x=>{const ds=p.derived.filter(d=>d.template_id===x.id),applied=ds.filter(d=>d.applied_version===x.version&&d.applied_template_id===x.id&&d.status==='ready').length;return `<tr><td class="person-name">${esc(x.name)}</td><td>${badge(x.kind==='employee'?'员工':'群聊')}</td><td>v${x.version}</td><td>${ds.length}</td><td>${ds.length?`${applied} / ${ds.length} 已应用`:badge('尚无派生档案','dim')}</td><td class="action-col"><button class="text-button" data-edit-template="${esc(x.id)}">编辑</button></td></tr>`;}).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:empty('尚无配置模板','只支持经过验证的非秘密字段，不接受任意代码、路径或命令。','file')}</div><p class="coverage">${icon('info')}<span>模板更新后需在 Profile 页面执行同步。已有会话可能保留首次配置，具体生效状态以持久会话记录为准。</span></p></section>`;
 $$('[data-group-kind]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{selectedGroupKind=b.dataset.groupKind;renderPage();});$('#new-group').onclick=()=>groupForm();$('#new-template').onclick=()=>templateForm();$$('[data-edit-group]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>groupForm(p.groups.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.editGroup)));$$('[data-edit-template]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>templateForm(p.templates.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.editTemplate)));
}
function groupForm(x){const v=x||{name:'',kind:selectedGroupKind,template_id:'',node_id:''};openDrawer(x?'编辑分组':'新建分组',`<form id="group-form"><label>分组名称<input name="name" required maxlength="128" value="${esc(v.name)}"></label><label>分组类型<select name="kind"${x?' disabled':''}><option value="employee"${v.kind==='employee'?' selected':''}>员工分组</option><option value="group"${v.kind==='group'?' selected':''}>群聊分组</option></select></label><label>配置模板<select name="template_id" required>${opt(profile().templates.filter(t=>t.kind===v.kind),v.template_id)}</select></label><label>目标 AI 节点<select name="node_id" required>${opt(profile().nodes.map(n=>({...n,name:n.name+' · '+status(n.status)})),v.node_id)}</select></label><div class="callout">分组是模板与节点的配置关系。成员各自保留独立档案；跨节点迁移未验证时会显示阻止状态。</div>${formEnd()}</form>`,'分组配置');const kind=$('[name=kind]');kind.onchange=()=>{$('[name=template_id]').innerHTML=opt(profile().templates.filter(t=>t.kind===kind.value));};bindForm(body=>management('groups'+(x?'/'+encodeURIComponent(x.id):''),x?'PUT':'POST',{...body,kind:x?.kind||body.kind}));}
function templateForm(x){const v=x||{name:'',kind:selectedGroupKind,soul:'',language:'zh-CN'};openDrawer(x?'编辑模板 · v'+x.version:'新建模板',`<form id="template-form"><label>模板名称<input name="name" required maxlength="128" value="${esc(v.name)}"></label><label>适用对象<select name="kind"${x?' disabled':''}><option value="employee"${v.kind==='employee'?' selected':''}>员工</option><option value="group"${v.kind==='group'?' selected':''}>群聊</option></select></label><label>SOUL · 系统行为说明<textarea name="soul" rows="10" maxlength="16000" required>${esc(v.soul)}</textarea></label><label>显示语言（display.language）<select name="language"><option value="zh-CN"${v.language==='zh-CN'?' selected':''}>简体中文</option><option value="en"${v.language==='en'?' selected':''}>English</option></select></label><div class="callout">只同步以上受管字段。历史、记忆、凭据和本地非受管配置保留。保存会增加模板版本，实际同步结果请在 Profile 页面核对。</div>${formEnd('保存模板版本')}</form>`,'受管字段');bindForm(body=>management('templates'+(x?'/'+encodeURIComponent(x.id):''),x?'PUT':'POST',{...body,kind:x?.kind||body.kind,expected_version:x?.version??null}));}
function derivedSubject(d){return d.kind==='employee'?profile().employees.find(x=>x.id===d.identity_id):profile().rooms.find(x=>String(x.id)===String(d.conversation_id));}
async function renderProfiles(){const p=profile();$('#main').innerHTML=`<section class="page">${heading('AI 节点与 Profile','先检查已登记测试节点，再为已分组员工或群创建独立档案。','<button id="new-profile" class="primary">创建独立 Profile</button>')}<div id="live-node-area" class="live-node-area"></div><div class="surface section-gap"><div class="surface-title"><h2>独立 Profile<span class="count">${p.derived.length}</span></h2><span class="help-text">创建、同步状态来自真实后端操作</span></div>${p.derived.length?`<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>员工 / 群</th><th>实际 Profile / 节点</th><th>模板版本</th><th>状态</th><th>失败原因 / 会话</th><th class="action-col">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${p.derived.map(d=>{const sessions=p.sessions.filter(s=>s.derived_id===d.id),pending=sessions.filter(s=>s.effective_status==='existing_session_pending').length;return `<tr><td><div class="person-name">${esc(derivedSubject(d)?.name||'未知主体')}</div><div class="row-note">${d.kind==='employee'?'员工私聊':'群聊档案'}</div></td><td><div class="mono">${esc(d.actual_profile||'尚未创建')}</div><div class="row-note">${esc(itemName(p.nodes,d.node_id))}</div></td><td><div>${esc(itemName(p.templates,d.template_id))}</div><div class="row-note">已应用 ${d.applied_version?'v'+d.applied_version:'无'} / 目标 v${d.desired_version}</div></td><td>${stateBadge(d.status)}</td><td>${d.last_error?`<div class="row-note error-text">${esc(d.last_error)}</div>`:badge('无已记录错误','dim')}${pending?`<div class="row-note">${pending} 个旧会话待生效 · 保留历史</div>`:`<div class="row-note">${sessions.length} 个持续会话</div>`}</td><td class="action-col"><button class="text-button" data-sync-profile="${esc(d.id)}"${['creating','syncing'].includes(d.status)?' disabled':''}>${d.status==='ready'?'同步 / 核对':'重试 / 同步'}</button><button class="text-button" data-profile-detail="${esc(d.id)}">详情</button></td></tr>`;}).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:empty('尚无派生 Profile','为已获权限且已分组的员工或已登记群创建独立档案。','layers')}</div><p class="coverage">${icon('info')}<span>独立 Profile 不构成文件权限或操作系统沙箱。此页面不提供删除历史、拷贝记忆、跨节点迁移或发消息按钮。</span></p></section>`;
 await window.CFConsoleNodes.render({root:$('#live-node-area'),api:consoleApi,reload:refreshState});$('#new-profile').onclick=deriveForm;
 $$('[data-sync-profile]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const d=p.derived.find(d=>d.id===b.dataset.syncProfile);runAction(b,()=>management('profiles/ensure','POST',{kind:d.kind,subject_id:d.kind==='employee'?d.identity_id:String(d.conversation_id)}),'Profile 管理操作已结束，请核对已应用版本及旧会话生效状态。');});
 $$('[data-profile-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const d=p.derived.find(d=>d.id===b.dataset.profileDetail),ss=p.sessions.filter(s=>s.derived_id===d.id);openDrawer(derivedSubject(d)?.name||'Profile',`${stateBadge(d.status)}<div class="detail-section">${dl([['实际 Profile',d.actual_profile],['目标节点',itemName(p.nodes,d.node_id)],['目标模板',itemName(p.templates,d.template_id)],['目标版本','v'+d.desired_version],['已应用版本',d.applied_version?'v'+d.applied_version:'尚未应用'],['失败原因',d.last_error||'无']])}</div><div class="detail-section"><h3>持续会话</h3>${ss.length?ss.map(s=>`<div class="record-card">${stateBadge(s.effective_status)}<p>首次模板 v${s.first_version}。${s.effective_status==='existing_session_pending'?'保留原会话和历史，更新尚未被该会话采用。':'当前会话按记录配置运行。'}</p>${diagnostic('会话身份',{conversation_id:s.conversation_id,hermes_session_id:s.hermes_session_id,thread_id:s.thread_id})}</div>`).join(''):'<p class="help-text">尚无持久会话。此管理台仅阅读，不触发 AI 请求。</p>'}</div>${diagnostic('Profile 绑定诊断',{id:d.id,kind:d.kind,identity_id:d.identity_id,conversation_id:d.conversation_id,node_id:d.node_id})}`,'独立档案');});
}
function nodeForm(){openDrawer('登记 AI 节点',`<form><label>节点名称<input name="name" required maxlength="128" placeholder="例如：隔离 Hermes 节点"></label><label>服务端连接引用<select name="connection_ref" required>${opt(profile().connection_refs.map(x=>({id:x,name:x})))}</select></label><div class="callout">连接地址、认证密钥及隔离范围由服务端配置。登记后需要检查目标能力。</div>${formEnd('登记节点')}</form>`,'目标节点');bindForm(v=>management('nodes','POST',v));}
function deriveForm(){openDrawer('创建独立 Profile',`<form id="derive-form"><label>业务主体类型<select name="kind"><option value="employee">员工私聊</option><option value="group">微信群</option></select></label><label>已登记主体<select name="subject_id" required></select></label><div class="callout">稳定身份决定 Profile 命名。已授权未分组会被拒绝；重复请求复用同一绑定。实际创建成功后才显示已就绪。</div>${formEnd('经管理后端创建')}</form>`,'受控创建');const subjects=()=>{const k=$('[name=kind]').value;$('[name=subject_id]').innerHTML=opt((k==='employee'?profile().employees:profile().rooms).map(x=>({...x,name:x.name+' · '+groupName(x.group_id)})));};$('[name=kind]').onchange=subjects;subjects();bindForm(v=>management('profiles/ensure','POST',v));}
async function renderSystem(){const p=profile();$('#main').innerHTML=`<section class="page">${heading('系统状态','来源与候选管理链的当前状态；详细身份和审计默认收起。')}<div id="live-system"></div><div class="summary-grid"><div class="summary-item"><span>微信来源</span><strong>${data.sources.length}</strong><p>源端只读，不发送消息或清未读</p></div><div class="summary-item"><span>已就绪独立档案</span><strong>${p.derived.filter(x=>x.status==='ready').length}</strong><p>共 ${p.derived.length} 个派生绑定</p></div><div class="summary-item"><span>在途 / 结果不确定</span><strong>${p.in_flight.length}</strong><p>权限变更不自动中断或重放</p></div></div><div class="surface"><div class="surface-title"><h2>微信数据来源</h2>${badge(data.mode==='demo'?'协议替身 · 合成数据':'只读来源','warn')}</div>${data.sources.map(s=>`<div class="status-row"><div><h3>${esc(s.label)} ${stateBadge(s.status)}</h3><p>${esc(s.bot_name||'尚未读取账号名称')} · 最近同步 ${fmt(s.last_sync_at)}</p><p>${esc(s.coverage||'尚未取得覆盖信息')}</p>${s.last_error?`<p class="error-text">最近错误：${esc(s.last_error)}</p>`:''}</div><button data-sync-source="${esc(s.id)}">同步读取</button></div>`).join('')||empty('尚无数据来源','请由服务端登记候选来源连接。','nodes')}</div><div class="surface section-gap"><div class="surface-title"><h2>服务范围</h2></div><div class="status-row"><div><h3>管理设置仅候选生效</h3><p>数据库中的员工、权限、分组与 Profile 操作不会自动改变生产路由。</p></div>${badge('候选隔离','good')}</div><div class="status-row"><div><h3>微信能力边界</h3><p>只读联系人、近期会话与持久化档案。全部群、群成员、发送、清未读及原件下载均未提供。</p></div>${badge('只读','dim')}</div></div>${diagnostic('来源同步诊断',data.sources.map(s=>({id:s.id,account_id:s.account_id,status:s.status,sync_details:s.sync_details,capabilities:s.capabilities})))}${diagnostic('管理审计（不含密码、Token 或消息正文）',p.audits)}${diagnostic('在途任务状态',p.in_flight)}</section>`;$$('[data-sync-source]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>runAction(b,()=>consoleApi('sources/'+encodeURIComponent(b.dataset.syncSource)+'/sync','POST',{}),'来源读取结束，请核对覆盖范围。'));await window.CFConsoleLive.renderSystem($('#live-system'));}
async function renderChats(generation){
 conversationResult=source?await consoleApi('conversations?'+query({source,...chatsQuery})):{items:[],total:0,offset:0,limit:20,coverage:'尚无已登记来源'};
 if(generation!==pageGeneration)return;chatItems=conversationResult.items;
 const list=chatItems.map(x=>`<button class="conversation-item${activeChat?.id===x.id?' active':''}" data-conversation="${esc(x.id)}" aria-label="打开 ${esc(x.display_name)} 的归档聊天">${avatar(x,x.kind==='group')}<span class="conversation-copy"><span class="conversation-top"><strong>${esc(x.display_name)}</strong><time>${esc(shortDate(x.last_at))}</time></span><span class="conversation-bottom"><span>${esc(x.last_message||'尚无消息摘要')}</span>${x.unread_count>0?`<span class="unread-count" title="微信快照未读，阅读不清零">${x.unread_count>99?'99+':x.unread_count}</span>`:''}</span></span></button>`).join('');
 $('#main').innerHTML=`<section class="chat-shell${activeChat?' reading-open':''}"><aside class="conversation-panel"><div class="conversation-heading"><h1>聊天</h1><form id="conversation-search" class="conversation-search"><label class="sr-only" for="chat-search">搜索会话</label><input id="chat-search" name="q" placeholder="搜索聊天名称" value="${esc(chatsQuery.q)}"><button aria-label="搜索会话">${icon('search')}</button></form></div><div class="conversation-count">共 ${conversationResult.total} 个已发现会话 · 已归档消息只读</div><div class="conversation-list">${list||empty('暂无会话',chatsQuery.q?'请调整会话搜索条件。':'请同步来源后查看已发现会话。','chat')}</div><div class="conversation-pagination">${pagination(conversationResult,'conversation-page')}</div></aside><div id="reading-panel" class="reading-panel">${activeChat?loading():`<div class="empty-reading">${empty('选择一段聊天','阅读已经持久化的消息档案。不会发送消息、触发 AI 或清除微信未读。','chat')}</div>`}</div></section>`;
 $('#conversation-search').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();chatsQuery.q=formValues(e.currentTarget).q;chatsQuery.offset=0;renderPage();};bindPager('conversation-page',chatsQuery,renderPage);
 $$('[data-conversation]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{activeChat=chatItems.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.conversation);messageQuery={q:'',sender:'',date_from:'',date_to:'',offset:0,limit:30};$$('[data-conversation]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));$('.chat-shell').classList.add('reading-open');renderMessages();});
 if(activeChat)await renderMessages();
}
let messageGeneration=0;
async function renderMessages(){window.CFConsoleLive?.clearNotice();const generation=++messageGeneration,chat=activeChat;if(!chat||!$('#reading-panel'))return;
 $('#reading-panel').innerHTML=`<header class="reading-header"><button class="icon-button mobile-back" id="back-to-chats" aria-label="返回会话列表">${icon('arrow')}</button><div class="reading-title">${avatar(chat,chat.kind==='group')}<div><h2>${esc(chat.display_name)}</h2><p>${chat.kind==='group'?'群聊档案':'私聊档案'} · ${chat.unread_count===null||chat.unread_count===undefined?'未读数：来源未提供':`微信快照未读 ${chat.unread_count} 条`}</p></div></div>${badge('只读归档','good')}</header><form class="message-filter" id="message-filter"><label>消息内容<input name="q" placeholder="搜索消息" value="${esc(messageQuery.q)}"></label><label>已归档发言者<select name="sender" aria-label="已归档发言者" disabled><option value="">正在读取发言者…</option></select></label><label class="date-field">开始日期（北京）<input type="date" name="date_from" value="${esc(messageQuery.date_from)}"></label><label class="date-field">结束日期（北京）<input type="date" name="date_to" value="${esc(messageQuery.date_to)}"></label><button type="submit">筛选</button><button type="button" id="reset-message-filter">重置</button></form><p class="message-coverage">正在读取持久化消息…</p><div class="messages" id="message-list">${loading()}</div><div id="message-pagination"></div><footer class="readonly-footer">只读档案 · 不发送消息，不清微信未读，不自动下载媒体原件</footer>`;
 $('#back-to-chats').onclick=()=>$('.chat-shell').classList.remove('reading-open');
 $('#message-filter').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const v=formValues(e.currentTarget);if(v.date_from&&v.date_to&&v.date_from>v.date_to){showToast('开始日期不能晚于结束日期。',true);return;}Object.assign(messageQuery,v,{offset:0});renderMessages();};
 $('#reset-message-filter').onclick=()=>{messageQuery={q:'',sender:'',date_from:'',date_to:'',offset:0,limit:30};renderMessages();};
 try{const result=await consoleApi('conversations/'+encodeURIComponent(chat.id)+'/messages?'+query({source,...messageQuery}));if(generation!==messageGeneration||activeChat?.id!==chat.id||!$('#message-list'))return;
  const senderSelect=$('#message-filter [name=sender]'),senderOptions=(result.sender_options||[]).map(x=>({id:x.id,name:x.name||'姓名未提供'}));
  senderSelect.innerHTML=opt(senderOptions,messageQuery.sender,'全部已归档发言者');
  if(messageQuery.sender&&!senderOptions.some(x=>x.id===messageQuery.sender))senderSelect.add(new Option('当前筛选（不在选项覆盖范围内）',messageQuery.sender,true,true));
  senderSelect.disabled=!senderOptions.length&&!messageQuery.sender;senderSelect.dataset.partial=String(!!result.sender_options_partial);
  $('.message-coverage').textContent=(result.coverage||'仅已持久化档案，历史可能存在缺口。')+' '+(result.sender_options_partial?'发言者仅展示最多 500 项已归档记录中的身份，选项存在覆盖缺口，非群成员名单。':'发言者选项来自已归档发言记录，非群成员名单。');
  let day='';const html=[...result.items].reverse().map(m=>{const current=fmt(m.occurred_at,true),divider=current!==day?`<div class="day-divider">${esc(current)}</div>`:'';day=current;return divider+messageCard(m);}).join('');
  const emptyMessages={not_synced:['来源尚未同步','请先同步当前来源，再核对可读取的持久化档案。'],no_archived_records:['尚无已归档会话','此联系人尚无可读取的持久化消息记录。此结论仅适用于已配置档案。'],no_records_in_range:['日期范围内没有已归档消息','请调整北京日期范围。历史停采及未归档消息不会在此补造。'],no_filter_results:['没有匹配的已归档消息','请调整内容或发起人筛选；此结果不代表会话没有其他消息。'],archive_not_configured:['尚未配置可读档案','当前来源未配置可读取的持久化档案，尚不能判断是否有历史消息。']};
  const emptyText=emptyMessages[result.status]||['此范围没有已归档消息','可调整关键词、发起人或日期范围。历史停采及未归档消息不会在此补造。'];
  $('#message-list').innerHTML=html||empty(emptyText[0],emptyText[1],'chat');
  $('#message-pagination').innerHTML=pagination(result,'message-page');bindPager('message-page',messageQuery,renderMessages);
  $('#message-list').scrollTop=$('#message-list').scrollHeight;
 }catch(error){if(generation!==messageGeneration||!$('#message-list'))return;$('.message-coverage').textContent='档案读取失败';$('#message-list').innerHTML=empty('消息未能加载',error.message,'info');$('#message-pagination').replaceChildren();}
}
function fileSize(n){return n<1024?n+' B':n<1024*1024?(n/1024).toFixed(1)+' KB':(n/1024/1024).toFixed(1)+' MB';}
function messageCard(m){
 const outgoing=['assistant','outbound','outgoing','self'].includes(m.direction);
 const quote=typeof m.reply==='string'?m.reply:(m.reply?.content||m.reply?.text||m.reply?.display_content||'引用消息内容未提供');
 const reply=m.reply?`<div class="quote">${esc(quote)}</div>`:'';
 const attachments=(m.attachments||[]).map(a=>`<div class="attachment"><span class="attachment-icon">${icon('file')}</span><div><div class="attachment-name">${esc(a.filename||'未命名附件')}</div><p>${a.file_size?esc(fileSize(a.file_size))+' · ':''}${esc(status(a.status))} · 原件未加载</p></div></div>`).join('');
 return `<article class="message${outgoing?' outgoing':''}" data-message-id="${esc(m.id)}" data-event-id="${esc(m.event_id||m.id)}" data-at="${esc(m.occurred_at)}"><span class="sr-only">${esc(fmt(m.occurred_at,true))}</span>${avatar({...m,display_name:m.sender_name,id:m.sender_id})}<div class="message-copy"><div class="message-meta"><span>${esc(m.sender_name||m.sender_id||'来源未提供')}</span><time>${esc(fmt(m.occurred_at))}</time></div><div class="bubble">${reply}${m.content?`<div class="message-text">${esc(m.content)}</div>`:''}${attachments}${!m.content&&!attachments?`<span class="muted">[${esc(m.message_type||'非文本消息')} · 媒体未加载]</span>`:''}</div>${m.delivery_status?`<div class="message-status">${esc(status(m.delivery_status))}</div>`:''}${m.message_type!=='text'&&!attachments?`<div class="message-status">${esc(m.media_status||'媒体原件未加载')}</div>`:''}</div></article>`;
}
function messageMatches(m){const day=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit'}).format(new Date(m.occurred_at));return (!messageQuery.q||m.content?.toLowerCase().includes(messageQuery.q.toLowerCase()))&&(!messageQuery.sender||m.sender_id===messageQuery.sender)&&(!messageQuery.date_from||day>=messageQuery.date_from)&&(!messageQuery.date_to||day<=messageQuery.date_to);}
async function applyLiveChanges(items){
 if(pageName!=='chats'||!$('.conversation-list'))return;
 const originalSource=source,originalPage=pageGeneration,originalChat=activeChat?.id,originalMessages=messageGeneration;
 const result=await consoleApi('conversations?'+query({source,...chatsQuery}));
 if(originalSource!==source||originalPage!==pageGeneration||!$('.conversation-list'))return;
 chatItems=result.items;conversationResult=result;
 $('.conversation-count').textContent=`共 ${result.total} 个已发现会话 · 已归档消息只读`;
 $('.conversation-pagination').innerHTML=pagination(result,'conversation-page');bindPager('conversation-page',chatsQuery,renderPage);
 const list=$('.conversation-list'),scroll=list.scrollTop;
 list.innerHTML=chatItems.map(x=>`<button class="conversation-item${activeChat?.id===x.id?' active':''}" data-conversation="${esc(x.id)}" aria-label="打开 ${esc(x.display_name)} 的归档聊天">${avatar(x,x.kind==='group')}<span class="conversation-copy"><span class="conversation-top"><strong>${esc(x.display_name)}</strong><time>${esc(shortDate(x.last_at))}</time></span><span class="conversation-bottom"><span>${esc(x.last_message||'尚无消息摘要')}</span></span></span></button>`).join('');list.scrollTop=scroll;
 $$('[data-conversation]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{activeChat=chatItems.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.conversation);messageQuery={q:'',sender:'',date_from:'',date_to:'',offset:0,limit:30};$$('[data-conversation]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));$('.chat-shell').classList.add('reading-open');renderMessages();});
 const messages=$('#message-list');if(!activeChat||activeChat.id!==originalChat||messageGeneration!==originalMessages||!messages||$('.initial-loading',messages))return;
 if(items.some(x=>x.conversation_id===activeChat.id)){
  const metadata=await consoleApi('conversations/'+encodeURIComponent(activeChat.id)+'/messages?'+query({source,...messageQuery,limit:1,offset:0}));
  if(originalSource!==source||originalPage!==pageGeneration||activeChat?.id!==originalChat||messageGeneration!==originalMessages||!messages.isConnected)return;
  $('#message-pagination').innerHTML=pagination({...metadata,limit:messageQuery.limit,offset:messageQuery.offset},'message-page');bindPager('message-page',messageQuery,renderMessages);
  const select=$('#message-filter [name=sender]'),options=(metadata.sender_options||[]).map(x=>({id:x.id,name:x.name||'姓名未提供'}));
  select.innerHTML=opt(options,messageQuery.sender,'全部已归档发言者');if(messageQuery.sender&&!options.some(x=>x.id===messageQuery.sender))select.add(new Option('当前筛选（不在选项覆盖范围内）',messageQuery.sender,true,true));select.disabled=!options.length&&!messageQuery.sender;
 }
 const fresh=items.filter(x=>x.conversation_id===activeChat.id&&messageMatches(x.message)&&!$$('[data-event-id]',messages).some(e=>e.dataset.eventId===(x.message.event_id||x.message.id)));
 if(!fresh.length)return;
 const atBottom=messages.scrollHeight-messages.clientHeight-messages.scrollTop<70;
 if(messageQuery.offset>0||!atBottom||$$('[data-message-id]',messages).length>180){window.CFConsoleLive.notice(fresh.length);return;}
 $('.empty-state',messages)?.remove();
 for(const item of fresh){const template=document.createElement('template');template.innerHTML=messageCard(item.message);const node=template.content.firstElementChild;const next=$$('[data-message-id]',messages).find(e=>Date.parse(e.dataset.at)>Date.parse(item.message.occurred_at));if(next)messages.insertBefore(node,next);else messages.append(node);node.dataset.displayedAt=new Date().toISOString();node.dataset.archivedAt=item.archived_at;node.dataset.upstreamReadableAt=item.upstream_readable_at;}
 $$('.day-divider',messages).forEach(e=>e.remove());let current='';$$('[data-message-id]',messages).forEach(e=>{const day=fmt(e.dataset.at,true);if(day!==current){const divider=document.createElement('div');divider.className='day-divider';divider.textContent=day;messages.insertBefore(divider,e);current=day;}});
 messages.scrollTop=messages.scrollHeight;
}
